  "[action] eldest son leaves for town",
  "[action] Wang Lung watches his eldest son depart and returns home.",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"The grain market will be a success. We will have more money than we know what to do with. I am going to take care of it myself.\"",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son returns home with his wife and children.",
  "[silence] Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "[action] Wang Lung sits in his rooms, feeling old.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung observes his eldest son's activities.",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"What is it, my dear? What are you doing?\"",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"I am not your servant, my dear, but your brother, and we are both sons of Wang Lung. I do not know why you do not go and make yourself useful in the market and set things in motion. It is I who have the money, and it is I who will take care of everything else. But I suppose you think you know better. I have no patience with you and will not waste my time with you.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung stays in his rooms, watching the chaos.",
